{"name":"Social Sharing Plugin &#8211; Kiwi","slug":"kiwi-social-share","version":"2.1.9.1","author":"<a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wpkube\/\">WPKube<\/a>","author_profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wpkube\/","contributors":{"wpkube":{"profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wpkube\/","avatar":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/52138fd4ab430bc2324018dc6bb3112caad5ea8353b8fc66cdb39bc91d768210?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g","display_name":"WPKube"}},"requires":"4.0","tested":"7.0.5","requires_php":"7.4","requires_plugins":[],"rating":82,"ratings":{"5":13,"4":0,"3":2,"2":0,"1":3},"num_ratings":18,"support_url":"https:\/\/wordpress.org\/support\/plugin\/kiwi-social-share\/","support_threads":0,"support_threads_resolved":0,"active_installs":4000,"last_updated":"2026-07-30 9:38am GMT","added":"2016-06-20","homepage":"","sections":{"description":"<p><strong>Kiwi Social Share<\/strong> is a standalone plugin built, maintained &amp; operated by the friendly folks over at <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wpkube.com\/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WPKube<\/a><\/p>\n<p>This is by far the best &amp; easiest to use WordPress social media share plugin. A WordPress share plugin with custom icons built-in.<\/p>\n<h4>Plugin Options<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Social networks available: Facebook, Twitter, LinkedIN, Pinterest and Flint.<\/li>\n<li>Turn on\/off each of them, individually.<\/li>\n<li>Great UI with intuitive &amp; simple options.<\/li>\n<li>Built for the regular user.<\/li>\n<li>Change the style of the article bar group.<\/li>\n<li>Display the number of counts next to the social network icon.<\/li>\n<li>Enable\/disable the floating bar.<\/li>\n<li>Change the shape of the floating bar\u2019s social buttons.<\/li>\n<li>Add social identities.<\/li>\n<li>Add a &#8220;Click to tweet&#8221; button in WordPress editor.<\/li>\n<li>Google Analytics tracking.<\/li>\n<li>Four different Skins.<\/li>\n<li>The default, square style.<\/li>\n<li>The more futuristic approach, shift style.<\/li>\n<li>The friendly approach, pill (rounded corners) style.<\/li>\n<li>The eye-catching approach, leaf style (like a leaf in the wind).<\/li>\n<li>Display social icons: before content, after content or both.<\/li>\n<li>Amazing loading speed.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>What&#8217;s Next?<\/h4>\n<p>If you like this plugin, then please consider leaving us a rating \/ review. This plugin is completely free and maintained by <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wpkube.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WPKube<\/a>, a WordPress resource site, where you can learn from our free WordPress tutorials like <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wpkube.com\/best-managed-wordpress-hosting\/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">how to choose the right managed WordPress hosting<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wpkube.com\/install-wordpress\/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">how to install WordPress<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wpkube.com\/best-wordpress-hosting\/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">choose the best shared hosting<\/a>, and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wpkube.com\/category\/wordpress-tutorials\/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">more<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Our other projects:<br \/>\n&#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.meridianthemes.net\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">MeridianThemes<\/a> &#8211; Beautiful hand-crafted themes for WordPress<br \/>\n&#8211; <a href=\"http:\/\/optinforms.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Optin Forms<\/a> &#8211; Simple and easy to use plugin for creating optin forms, works with most well know autoresponder services.<\/p>\n","installation":"<p>This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the whole contents of the folder <code>kiwi-social-share<\/code> to the <code>\/wp-content\/plugins\/<\/code> directory<\/li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress<\/li>\n<li>Enjoy using it \ud83d\ude42<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n","faq":"<p>Available filters (used for frontend rendering)<br \/>\nArticle Bar Filters<br \/>\n    kiwi_article_bar_list_custom_class<br \/>\n    kiwi_before_article_bar<br \/>\n    kiwi_before_first_article_bar_item<br \/>\n    kiwi_after_last_article_bar_item<br \/>\n    kiwi_after_article_bar<\/p>\n<p>Floating Bar Filters<br \/>\n    kiwi_floating_bar_list_custom_class<br \/>\n    kiwi_before_floating_bar<br \/>\n    kiwi_before_first_floating_bar_item<br \/>\n    kiwi_after_last_floating_bar_item<br \/>\n    kiwi_after_floating_bar<\/p>\n","changelog":"<h4>2.1.9.1<\/h4>\n<p>Minor tweak<\/p>\n<h4>2.1.9<\/h4>\n<p>Tested up to 7.0<\/p>\n<h4>2.1.8<\/h4>\n<p>Security fixes<\/p>\n<h4>2.1.7<\/h4>\n<p>Fix for icons not showing in some edge cases<\/p>\n<h4>2.1.6<\/h4>\n<p>Fix for when WordPress returns a post type of NULL<\/p>\n<h4>2.1.5<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>CMB2 is no longer used for metaboxes. Custom system is implemented<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.1.4<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed issue with twitter share links being broken in some cases<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.1.3<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed security issues<\/li>\n<li>Code cleanup<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.1.0<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>All PRO features are now available in this version<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.16<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixes issue with &#8220;highlight to share&#8221; not working ( CSS\/JS not loaded ) for some pages<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.15<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Facebook share counts no longer work without a Facebook Developer App (https:\/\/developers.facebook.com\/apps). Options to support connection via Facebook App are added in WP Admin &gt; Kiwi &gt; Social Identity. The options are &#8220;Facebook App Id&#8221; and &#8220;Facebook App Secret&#8221;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.14<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove uninstall feedback<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.13<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed &#8220;Trying to get property \u2018post_content\u2019 when there is no id, like 404&#8221;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.11<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improve performance<\/li>\n<li>Fixed security issue<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.10<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update CMB2<\/li>\n<li>Improved Admin UI<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.9<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor Fixes<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.8<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Fintel network<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.7<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>added uninstall feedback<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.6<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>WP 4.9 compatibility<\/li>\n<li>Remove url encode on twitter button<\/li>\n<li>WhatsApp button didn&#8217;t look alright on fit<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.4<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed box shadow in the admin window<\/li>\n<li>Changed how URLS are encoded for text<\/li>\n<li>WhatsApp icon visibility is now handled with CSS ( wp_is_mobile function would not work on websites with cache )<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.3<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Saving settings would cause errors on some servers<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.2<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Ajax request failed on license activation<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.1<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor bugs<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.0<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Major upgrade<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.4<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>When checked, the Google+ icon wasn\u2019t showing up. Fix provided via GitHub by @smartinsalmeida<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.3<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Increased the weight on the front-end selectors so that margin &amp; padding are harder to get overwritten by themes. Feels like some themes don&#8217;t want to play nice<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.2<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed a small bug where content wasn&#8217;t being returned if kiwi was turned off on posts and pages.<\/li>\n<li>Added share bar margins top\/bottom.<\/li>\n<li>Fixed a small rendering bug in the back-end for images.<\/li>\n<li>Fixed a small bug where content wasn&#8217;t being returned on !is_singular() pages (archives)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.1<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Replaced Kiwi Logo with Dashicons icon<\/li>\n<li>Fixed a small bug with the notifications bar overlapping the form badge<\/li>\n<li>Enhanced the way we control sortables. When you disable a radio within a sortable, that sortable gets it\u2019s opacity lowered.<\/li>\n<li>Properly formatted JS code with PHPStorm formatting.<\/li>\n<li>Small assets\/back-end\/images\/ re-organization. Now, social icons have been renamed and moved into their own folder.<\/li>\n<li>Slightly re-worked the sortable\/draggable field to support icons. No more CSS background images<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.0<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","screenshots":"<ol><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/kiwi-social-share\/assets\/screenshot-1.png?rev=1650215\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/kiwi-social-share\/assets\/screenshot-1.png?rev=1650215\" alt=\"Screenshot of the back-end User Interface. All options are displayed above the fold (no scrolling, no fiddling around). Really easy to use.\"><\/a><p>Screenshot of the back-end User Interface. All options are displayed above the fold (no scrolling, no fiddling around). Really easy to use.<\/p><\/li><\/ol>","reviews":"<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">The best: great support<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wampirius\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/80610d8c2703988ba4e48f14dcf112a260dc9c8067d3922bed366cc30802f8be?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/80610d8c2703988ba4e48f14dcf112a260dc9c8067d3922bed366cc30802f8be?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wampirius\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">wampirius<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 3, 2022<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\">Hello.\n\nThe buttons look perfect and it works great, but the best thing by far is the support.\n\nI had a problem and I reported it on a Sunday afternoon, well, the next day, Monday, at just over ten in the morning they released an update that corrected the problem. There are payment services that are far from having such fast and effective attention.\n\nBest regards\n\nCarlos.\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Easy to use, pretty and great support<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/mish99\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/c37261265fe717b2f48928a07d2a0312b67db6658023b44820a514cd7ceaaf5d?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/c37261265fe717b2f48928a07d2a0312b67db6658023b44820a514cd7ceaaf5d?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/mish99\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">mish99<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">April 17, 2019<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\">I like Kiwi over the other social sharing plugins I have tried because it is easy to use (I am a non-technical user), the share buttons look great and when I asked for support it arrived quickly, in plain english and with enough instructions.\n\nThank you<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great plugin<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/mbrsolution\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/91b93a12b1c96b586542f804178b069d2547325521e022eb35f0e67fc39e548d?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/91b93a12b1c96b586542f804178b069d2547325521e022eb35f0e67fc39e548d?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/mbrsolution\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">mbrsolution<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">March 5, 2019<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\">I was looking for a simple social sharing plugin that allowed me to share a few social sharing buttons like Facebook and Twitter. So far this plugin fits my needs and works well in my site. There is also a pro version if you need to add more social sharing services to your site. \n\nWell done.\n\nKind regards<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Horribly restricted in free mode<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wingrider\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/345f7569d6f0643a2de515e276f5a3e4e9c89bbd0ff64e8d2d6f8aadb4bcff13?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/345f7569d6f0643a2de515e276f5a3e4e9c89bbd0ff64e8d2d6f8aadb4bcff13?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wingrider\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">WingRider<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">January 23, 2019<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\">This is a horribly restricted plugin. Doesnt seem to support many social media sharing options, including email or RSS in free mode. \n\nAlso doesnt let you just add this to posts. As a result, its a big fail.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Site speed!!!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/julickot\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/d3c4b4d6d825914bda4d69972ed143c379366aa38b03168e7c30776501ca4989?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/d3c4b4d6d825914bda4d69972ed143c379366aa38b03168e7c30776501ca4989?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/julickot\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">julickot<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">November 27, 2018<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\">I install version 2.0.12 of Kiwi. Waiting (TTFB) - 10.89 sec !!!\nAfter deactivating plugin. Waiting (TTFB) - 454 ms!!! <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Page speed<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/lazdu\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/48ec968e577a3024827f010348b9fc271220f43c70458c090ca1469d6063de03?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/48ec968e577a3024827f010348b9fc271220f43c70458c090ca1469d6063de03?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/lazdu\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">OldSchoolGuy <small>(lazdu)<\/small><\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 8, 2018<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\">4 days I was configuring, optimazing my Woocommerce site becouse load time was 6-9 sec. \nAfter deactivating this plugin. Page load time 3 sec.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Excellent PLugin<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/tperezdevelopment\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/51735e6b5f86861ee6409b689ed25f62334e42e7c5012017b0a6fcf295d88053?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/51735e6b5f86861ee6409b689ed25f62334e42e7c5012017b0a6fcf295d88053?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/tperezdevelopment\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">tperezdevelopment<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">August 7, 2018<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\">Excellent PLugin, just need to allow put text header like tittle Share us, for example<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Plugin description lists premium features<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"3 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"3\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/oldrup\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/02ba25a6e28011bd59821fd25e7782e829db1362462df062a101302bfa7d7200?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/02ba25a6e28011bd59821fd25e7782e829db1362462df062a101302bfa7d7200?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/oldrup\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Bjarne Oldrup <small>(oldrup)<\/small><\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">July 16, 2018<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><em>Update: Plugin Description has been edited, clearly stating what features are free and what are premium.<\/em>\n\nWas looking for a sharing button allowing share via email. Kiwi Social Share lists that as a feature of the plugin. But after installing the plugin, it's revealed that share via email is a premium feature..\n\nI've got no problem with the free\/premium feature price model, but don't list features here on wordpress.org that aren't free without explicitly stating that they are premium features - it's just wasting everybodys time.\n\nBest regards\nBjarne\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great and lightweight!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/darknezx\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/6e157274bece21f380355ecbba2316a0cfec67934b4ddb080d8c2f97e34f50d9?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/6e157274bece21f380355ecbba2316a0cfec67934b4ddb080d8c2f97e34f50d9?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/darknezx\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">darknezx<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">July 9, 2018<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\">Exceeded expectations.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great but...<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/timhugall\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/0e7250fc2c50ea28fa917c458406058b46ab9fbc95185bc2145291f6648a361b?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/0e7250fc2c50ea28fa917c458406058b46ab9fbc95185bc2145291f6648a361b?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/timhugall\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">timhugall<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">May 22, 2018<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\">...would love to see Twitch support!<\/div>\n<\/div>\n"},"download_link":"https:\/\/downloads.wordpress.org\/plugin\/kiwi-social-share.2.1.9.1.zip","upgrade_notice":[],"screenshots":{"1":{"src":"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/kiwi-social-share\/assets\/screenshot-1.png?rev=1650215","caption":"Screenshot of the back-end User Interface. All options are displayed above the fold (no scrolling, no fiddling around). Really easy to use."}},"tags":{"facebook":"facebook","share-buttons":"share buttons","social":"social","social-media":"social media","so